OL,3,GNEWSATwo airlifted to hospital after
OL,4,Abus collides with train stopped on
OL,5,AFrench side of Channel Tunnel
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo people have been airlifted to
OL,8,Fhospital following a crash between a
OL,9,Ffreight train and a bus at the entrance
OL,10,Fto the Channel Tunnel in France
OL,12,FPas-de-Calais Under Prefect Agathe Cury
OL,13,Fsays 19 people in total, including the
OL,14,Fdriver of the bus, are injured - but
OL,15,Fnone are in critical conditions
OL,17,FShe adds that an investigation is now
OL,18,Funder way to assess the causes of the
OL,19,Fincident, which she describes as the
OL,20,F"first" of this type
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
