OL,3,GNEWSATwo airlifted to hospital after
OL,4,Abus collides with train stopped on
OL,5,AFrench side of Channel Tunnel
OL,6,
OL,7,FLocal officials in Pas-de-Calais say
OL,8,Fthe incident occurred where vehicles
OL,9,Fwere boarding the Le Shuttle at the
OL,10,Floading platform for the Eurotunnel
